<title>GERMANY: Buba revises down Feb Pan-German industry orders.</title>
<headline>Buba revises down Feb Pan-German industry orders.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bundesbank provided the following revised index figures:</p>
<p>    PAN-GERMAN INDUSTRY ORDERS   Feb 97	   Jan 97</p>
<p> Month-on-month change(pct)	 -0.2	     +2.7</p>
<p> Year-on-year (pct)		   +5.8	     +4.7</p>
<p> Index (base 1991)		    98.6 (99.0)    98.8</p>
<p>WEST GERMAN INDUSTRY ORDERS</p>
<p> Month-on-month change(pct)	 -0.6	     +3.0</p>
<p> Year-on-year (pct)		   +5.3	     +4.3</p>
<p> Index (base 1991)		    96.9 (97.3)    97.5</p>
<p>EAST GERMAN INDUSTRY ORDERS</p>
<p> Month-on-month change(pct)	 +6.5	     -0.8</p>
<p> Year-on-year (pct)		  +10.1	    +11.5</p>
<p> Index (base 1991)		   140.0 (138.0)  131.5</p>
<p>NOTE - Figures are seasonally adjusted. The percentage change figures are calculated by Reuters from the indices.</p>
<p>Previously announced data in brackets.</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49-228-26097150</p>
</text>
